meta {
  name: Fetch companies from Wikidata
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/companies/wikidata/fetch
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{adminAccessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "query": "allgeier",
  //   "location": "München",
  //   "industry": "Sicherheit",
    "limit": 10,
    "offset": 0
  }
}

docs {
  Fetch companies from Wikidata without saving them.

  Request Body (CompanySearchParams):
  - `query`: company name contains (optional)
  - `location`: headquarters name contains (optional)
  - `industry`: industry name contains (optional)
  - `limit`: maximum results, 1-100, default 20
  - `offset`: pagination offset, default 0

  Employee and founding year filters are not supported by Wikidata.

  - 200: OK - array of normalized companies
  - 400: Bad Request - invalid parameters
  - 401: Unauthorized - run Login
  - 403: Forbidden - not an admin, run Login as admin
  - 500: Internal Server Error - Wikidata request failed
}